<title>UK: Bradford and Bingley sets $300 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>Bradford and Bingley sets $300 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Lehman Brothers.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BRADFORD AND BINGLEY BUILDING SOCIETY</p>
<p> AMT    $300 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY	.FEB.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +1/16     PAY DATE    18.FEB.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A1	  ISS PRICE  99.967    FULL FEES   0.175</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   =	   REOFFER    99.967</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  UK	  TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
